      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "`values`: A dictionary containing the values persisted in an external store with keys corresponding to the names of the property description in the `NSEntityDescription` object described by `objectID`: - For attributes: an immutable value (an instance of a value class such as `NSNumber`, `NSString`, `NSData`). Missing attribute keys will assume a nil value.",
