      "normalizedSource": "For to-many relationships: an instance of `NSArray` or `NSSet` containing the managed object IDs of the related objects. Empty to-many relationships must be represented by an empty non-nil collection. A missing key will be resolved lazily through calling `newValueForRelationship:forObjectWithID:withContext:error:` on the `NSPersistentStore` object. Lazy resolution for to-many relationships is encouraged. Unknown or unmodeled keys are stripped out.",
      "sourceHash": "8accf44f98c0b37a51092019b52be1e07d71201b91c2d16301f5e6282501e3a3",
